OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy overnight with a few
OL,7,Fspots of rain possible at times, there
OL,8,Fis likely to be extensive low cloud
OL,9,Fand hill fog over the higher ground.
OL,10,FAnother warm and fairly humid night
OL,11,Facross the country.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FLargely cloudy skies on Monday
OL,14,Fwith a few outbreaks of rain or
OL,15,Fdrizzle possible at times. Some warm
OL,16,Fand humid brighter spells also likely
OL,17,Fin the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
